  "tip": "<p>Match the requirement for <i>strong consistency</i> and <i>multi region</i> replication first. If replicas are <i>asynchronous</i> then you cannot guarantee consistent reads across regions, so look for a service that provides synchronous replication and simple operations.</p>",
